WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.915
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.185 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:34.385 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:42.945 --> 01:46.945
They were such a loving couple, and now they're suddenly getting divorced?

5
01:47.025 --> 01:48.585
There wasn't even a hint of trouble.

6
01:49.265 --> 01:51.385
They should never have married.

7
01:52.065 --> 01:54.585
Her birth mother is immoral and despised.

8
01:55.185 --> 01:57.185
She grew up with no proper guidance,

9
01:57.265 --> 02:00.545
so she's headstrong, arrogant, and reckless.

10
02:00.625 --> 02:03.025
She's unfit to be a member of the Lu family.

11
02:03.705 --> 02:07.385
Mother! Help, Mother!

12
02:07.465 --> 02:09.304
-What happened? -Mother!

13
02:09.385 --> 02:10.665
-Slow down. -Slow down.

14
02:10.744 --> 02:11.585
-Oh my! -My goodness!

15
02:11.665 --> 02:14.025
Wanniang, what are you doing?

16
02:14.105 --> 02:18.345
Please find a way to keep Wei Rao here, whatever it takes.

17
02:18.865 --> 02:21.305
The night she married into our family,

18
02:21.385 --> 02:24.185
Lu Zhuo woke up.

19
02:24.265 --> 02:26.945
And today, as soon as she said she was leaving,

20
02:27.025 --> 02:30.465
he started coughing up blood again!

21
02:30.545 --> 02:33.465
Heaven has bound their fates together.

22
02:33.545 --> 02:36.545
If they part, disaster is sure to follow!

23
02:37.225 --> 02:39.105
If they really divorce,

24
02:39.185 --> 02:43.705
Lu Zhuo may not survive!

25
02:45.265 --> 02:48.345
Mother, I'm begging you!

26
02:48.425 --> 02:52.385
You must find a way to stop Wei Rao from leaving!

27
02:53.745 --> 02:56.225
Have you no dignity, sobbing like this?

28
02:56.305 --> 02:57.385
-Get up. -Wanniang.

29
02:57.465 --> 02:59.385
-Please get up. -Get up.

30
02:59.465 --> 03:02.025
Wanniang, get up first.

31
03:04.465 --> 03:07.305
Mother, let me try to persuade Wei Rao first.

32
03:07.385 --> 03:09.345
-Then we can decide what to do. -Go.

33
03:14.585 --> 03:16.745
Your qi is blocked by grief and inflamed by sudden rage.

34
03:16.825 --> 03:18.025
You must calm your mind…

35
03:18.105 --> 03:19.665
My Lord, you mustn't get up.

36
03:19.745 --> 03:21.385
My Lord, you mustn't move!

37
03:21.465 --> 03:22.345
Don't touch me.

38
03:23.985 --> 03:26.905
My Lord, whatever the matter is, it must wait until you've recovered.

39
03:27.505 --> 03:29.105
-I want to see Wei Rao. -My Lord!

40
03:29.185 --> 03:30.265
-Out of my way! -My Lord!

41
03:30.345 --> 03:31.505
Quick, help him.

42
03:33.225 --> 03:34.425
Rao,

43
03:34.505 --> 03:36.465
you were lost young, left to the streets.

44
03:36.545 --> 03:38.985
Life would have had you miss this marriage.

45
03:39.065 --> 03:41.345
Yet, through a twist of fate, you found the way back to him.

46
03:41.425 --> 03:44.905
This bond was forged by Heaven. No one can break it.

47
03:45.665 --> 03:47.545
Why are you so determined to sever it?

48
03:47.625 --> 03:50.865
Has the Lu family mistreated you, or has Lu Zhuo hurt you?

49
03:58.025 --> 04:00.905
The Lu family and His Lordship have treated me well.

50
04:01.985 --> 04:04.585
Lu Zhuo has saved me from danger many times.

51
04:05.305 --> 04:07.905
He even defied imperial decrees and deceived His Majesty.

52
04:08.585 --> 04:10.505
The Duke accused him of grave defiance,

53
04:10.585 --> 04:13.505
neglecting his duties, and violating family rules, all because of me.

54
04:16.745 --> 04:18.384
It's precisely because he's so good to me

55
04:19.465 --> 04:20.705
that I must divorce him.

56
04:20.785 --> 04:23.345
You want a divorce because he's good to you?

57
04:23.425 --> 04:25.665
Rao, what you're saying makes no sense to me.

58
04:25.745 --> 04:26.865
I simply can't understand it.

59
04:28.305 --> 04:30.745
I've always been alone and know nothing of love.

60
04:30.825 --> 04:33.065
I cannot return his deep affection.

61
04:33.745 --> 04:37.905
By leaving, I can spare him a wasted life.

62
04:38.865 --> 04:41.545
I was once an orphan with no one to turn to.

63
04:42.505 --> 04:44.985
I relied on His Lordship's protection to stay safe.

64
04:45.985 --> 04:47.265
Now I've reclaimed my place in my birth family.

65
04:47.825 --> 04:49.865
I have a fief and troops of my own.

66
04:53.785 --> 04:55.945
With my birth mother's power behind me,

67
04:56.465 --> 04:58.065
I can live as happily as I please.

68
04:59.705 --> 05:02.505
Why stay here and suffer everyone's scorn?

69
05:06.745 --> 05:08.505
Being Lu Zhuo's wife

70
05:09.985 --> 05:12.065
is like living under a roof that forces me to stoop.

71
05:13.065 --> 05:15.985
I must obey every rule and be a virtuous wife.

72
05:16.585 --> 05:19.945
Every day I stay here is another day without joy.

73
05:21.825 --> 05:22.745
Please let me go.

74
05:26.185 --> 05:29.225
Do you truly feel nothing for Lu Zhuo?

75
05:36.425 --> 05:37.265
Nothing.

76
05:49.545 --> 05:50.425
You should leave.

77
06:07.665 --> 06:09.185
Since you've made your decision,

78
06:11.025 --> 06:14.145
have a carriage prepared to escort the Noble Lady away.

79
06:18.185 --> 06:20.025
-My Lord… -Go!

80
06:26.225 --> 06:27.345
Lu Zhuo.

81
06:28.985 --> 06:29.905
Rao.

82
06:32.625 --> 06:34.225
Why pretend to care?

83
06:35.065 --> 06:36.345
Lu Zhuo, calm down.

84
06:36.425 --> 06:38.225
Mother will never agree to this.

85
06:38.305 --> 06:39.665
I've made my decision.

86
06:41.265 --> 06:42.465
Thank you.

87
06:43.265 --> 06:45.185
I'm the one who should thank you,

88
06:47.145 --> 06:48.465
Noble Lady Wu'an.

89
06:50.785 --> 06:52.905
Thank you for being honest

90
06:54.065 --> 06:55.865
and letting me see who you really are.

91
06:57.785 --> 06:59.185
Don't think too highly of yourself.

92
06:59.825 --> 07:01.665
I can live without you.

93
07:02.265 --> 07:04.305
This marriage is a mistake.

94
07:06.025 --> 07:07.505
The sooner we end it, the better.

95
07:08.785 --> 07:10.345
You're magnanimous and understanding, My Lord.

96
07:11.345 --> 07:12.225
That puts my mind at ease.

97
07:14.225 --> 07:15.745
I won't see you off, Your Ladyship.

98
07:18.585 --> 07:19.705
You may go.

99
07:20.465 --> 07:22.425
Fine. One of you is heartless, and the other is too proud

100
07:22.505 --> 07:23.865
to speak honestly.

101
07:23.945 --> 07:26.345
I shouldn't have interfered. I shouldn't have come at all.

102
07:30.585 --> 07:32.065
Thank you for granting my wish.

103
07:40.065 --> 07:41.105
Keep packing.

104
07:46.265 --> 07:48.985
SONGYUE HALL

105
07:57.505 --> 07:59.625
My Lady, everything is packed.

106
08:05.305 --> 08:07.145
Why are there two more chests than we counted?

107
08:10.185 --> 08:13.385
-Everything is here. -Okay.

108
08:13.465 --> 08:14.665
Be careful.

109
08:15.425 --> 08:16.465
Understood.

110
08:16.545 --> 08:17.585
-Remember to take this. -All right.

111
08:20.665 --> 08:22.705
When Grandmother asked to expedite our wedding,…

112
08:23.705 --> 08:27.425
she promised the Wei family that if you ever left the Lu family,

113
08:29.465 --> 08:31.185
we would give you extra gold as a dowry.

114
08:33.985 --> 08:35.105
I'm honoring that promise.

115
08:36.225 --> 08:38.225
I'm a lucky beast Pixiu reborn.

116
08:38.305 --> 08:39.705
I love money more than anything.

117
08:39.784 --> 08:41.664
If you're willing to offer, I'll gladly take it.

118
08:42.264 --> 08:45.585
Think of yourself as a partner in my estate.

119
08:45.665 --> 08:48.145
When the harvest comes, you'll get a fifth.

120
08:48.225 --> 08:49.105
No need.

121
08:52.985 --> 08:54.225
If you leave, no need to see me again.

122
08:55.945 --> 08:56.985
I'll have someone deliver it.

123
08:58.505 --> 09:02.025
Stop, all of you! No one is to move anything!

124
09:03.105 --> 09:04.505
Rao,

125
09:04.585 --> 09:07.265
what has made you unhappy here in the Lu family?

126
09:07.345 --> 09:08.585
Why are you so determined to divorce?

127
09:08.665 --> 09:10.865
Unless you give me a proper explanation,

128
09:10.945 --> 09:12.145
I won't let you leave.

129
09:12.225 --> 09:14.185
Mother, don't make this difficult for her.

130
09:15.105 --> 09:16.785
His Majesty has issued the decree.

131
09:17.305 --> 09:18.665
I don't care.

132
09:19.625 --> 09:22.105
My husband died in battle.

133
09:22.665 --> 09:25.985
You, my son, are the one person in my life that has kept me going.

134
09:26.065 --> 09:30.305
If anything happens to you, I won't go on living!

135
09:30.385 --> 09:33.825
If the imperial family wants to punish me, let them come and cut off my head!

136
09:34.465 --> 09:37.385
Rao, is something troubling you?

137
09:37.465 --> 09:40.585
You can tell me. I'll see that you're treated fairly.

138
09:41.225 --> 09:43.505
Grandmother, Mother,

139
09:44.625 --> 09:47.465
-in fact, I… -Rao,

140
09:47.545 --> 09:49.225
I'm begging you.

141
09:49.305 --> 09:51.425
Please stay.

142
09:52.465 --> 09:53.745
Enough, Mother!

143
09:53.825 --> 09:56.145
The men of the Lu family, in every generation,

144
09:57.305 --> 09:58.865
are fated to die only in battle.

145
10:00.145 --> 10:03.265
My life was spared on the battlefield.

146
10:04.505 --> 10:05.865
That means my time has not yet come.

147
10:07.305 --> 10:09.145
The idea that this marriage saved me is absurd.

148
10:09.225 --> 10:10.065
Never mention it again.

149
10:11.825 --> 10:14.065
Besides, Wei Rao isn't the one seeking a divorce.

150
10:17.865 --> 10:18.905
I am.

151
10:19.505 --> 10:21.745
You… Why would you do this?

152
10:24.425 --> 10:26.185
I used to mistake Wei Rao for Jundai.

153
10:27.505 --> 10:29.145
I believed her to be cruel and vicious,

154
10:29.865 --> 10:31.585
so I despised her and kept testing her.

155
10:32.665 --> 10:33.865
To this day,…

156
10:37.345 --> 10:38.345
we have never consummated our marriage.

157
10:38.425 --> 10:39.465
You…

158
10:41.145 --> 10:44.665
For a bride, what could be more humiliating?

159
10:44.745 --> 10:47.025
Lu Zhuo, you're usually so sensible.

160
10:47.105 --> 10:50.425
How could you make such an outrageous mistake?

161
10:51.225 --> 10:53.025
Though Wei Rao is of the Wei family's blood,

162
10:53.865 --> 10:55.865
she was abandoned as a child

163
10:55.945 --> 10:57.545
and did menial work to survive.

164
10:58.545 --> 10:59.745
All noble ladies of the capital

165
11:00.345 --> 11:02.625
are excel at music, weiqi, calligraphy, and painting.

166
11:02.705 --> 11:05.505
They're virtuous, well-spoken, graceful, and skilled in the domestic arts.

167
11:06.745 --> 11:09.585
She alone has none of these qualities.

168
11:09.665 --> 11:11.625
How could a woman with so little virtue or talent

169
11:12.225 --> 11:13.705
be fit to be my wife?

170
11:13.785 --> 11:14.905
You…!

171
11:17.185 --> 11:19.825
-Mother! -You foolish boy!

172
11:19.905 --> 11:22.625
How can you look down on your own wife like this?

173
11:22.705 --> 11:23.905
Mother, don't blame him.

174
11:23.985 --> 11:25.465
It's not your place to speak!

175
11:26.745 --> 11:27.785
We are

176
11:29.665 --> 11:30.545
not right for each other.

177
11:32.665 --> 11:35.425
To free ourselves, we have to divorce.

178
11:35.505 --> 11:36.705
You…!

179
11:36.785 --> 11:38.105
I'm the one determined to leave the Lu family.

180
11:38.825 --> 11:40.065
It's not his fault.

181
11:40.145 --> 11:41.345
Enough!

182
11:42.145 --> 11:44.705
What's done is done. We can't stop them.

183
11:46.065 --> 11:47.425
Let them be!

184
11:49.425 --> 11:50.265
How…

185
11:50.985 --> 11:54.505
How can you be so foolish?

186
11:56.145 --> 11:57.945
You've shown me such kindness and care.

187
11:59.025 --> 11:59.985
I'll never forget it.

188
12:02.225 --> 12:03.785
Please take care of yourselves.

189
12:05.185 --> 12:06.225
I bid you farewell.

190
12:12.705 --> 12:14.225
Rao…

191
13:19.705 --> 13:23.425
SONGYUE HALL

192
13:25.025 --> 13:26.945
You let her go today.

193
13:27.825 --> 13:30.905
I hope you won't regret it later.

194
13:32.465 --> 13:34.145
She chose to leave me.

195
13:38.705 --> 13:40.145
What is there to regret?

196
13:50.905 --> 13:53.505
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

197
13:54.505 --> 13:56.105
If Heaven truly answers prayers,

198
13:57.305 --> 13:59.665
I, Wei Rao, willingly give up this marriage

199
13:59.745 --> 14:01.185
and vow never to marry again.

200
14:02.145 --> 14:04.185
In return, please let him soon find a beautiful wife

201
14:05.145 --> 14:08.905
who will cherish him, respect him, and treat him well.

202
14:11.705 --> 14:13.745
His Lordship ordered me to escort Your Ladyship out of the city.

203
14:14.705 --> 14:16.585
Are you going to Mount Yaowang?

204
14:16.665 --> 14:17.505
No.

205
14:18.705 --> 14:21.105
-I'd like to visit somewhere first. -Understood.

206
14:30.025 --> 14:33.825
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

207
14:41.305 --> 14:42.625
You needn't follow me.

208
14:47.865 --> 14:50.825
MY COUSIN JUNDAI

209
14:56.265 --> 14:57.585
I never expected this.

210
14:58.745 --> 15:00.905
You're the only one who's come to visit her.

211
15:01.665 --> 15:03.185
Haven't you come too?

212
15:05.025 --> 15:07.265
Her birth mother, Wei, has been exiled far away.

213
15:07.345 --> 15:08.945
Her birth father's whereabouts are unknown.

214
15:10.305 --> 15:11.545
Fearing Lady Li's power,

215
15:12.705 --> 15:14.425
the Earl of Cheng'an's household dared not prepare her for burial.

216
15:15.065 --> 15:18.785
So it fell to me, an outsider,

217
15:19.945 --> 15:23.745
to take care of her remains and lay her to rest.

218
15:25.425 --> 15:28.585
But Wei Rao, why have you come?

219
15:29.305 --> 15:30.905
Of all people in this world,

220
15:31.425 --> 15:33.505
you should hate Jundai the most.

221
15:36.425 --> 15:37.785
Before Jundai died,

222
15:39.465 --> 15:40.505
she said something to me.

223
15:41.545 --> 15:42.585
What did she say?

224
15:50.585 --> 15:52.665
My life was never my own.

225
15:54.025 --> 15:55.785
Neither is my death.

226
15:57.545 --> 16:00.105
Those who loved me abandoned me.

227
16:01.225 --> 16:02.105
Those I love…

228
16:05.185 --> 16:08.305
No one's ever taught me what love is.

229
16:09.305 --> 16:12.105
I spent my whole life striving for fame and status,

230
16:12.905 --> 16:15.185
struggling with all I had.

231
16:16.545 --> 16:17.665
And what did I gain?

232
16:21.625 --> 16:23.745
I'm left with nothing.

233
16:25.265 --> 16:26.665
Wei Rao…

234
16:40.785 --> 16:43.825
"I lived in splendor, clothed in silk."

235
16:44.745 --> 16:46.745
"Yet in death, I'll lie in a lonely grave outside the city."

236
16:47.345 --> 16:49.625
"Who brought me into this world?"

237
16:50.145 --> 16:52.025
"Who has ever truly loved me?"

238
16:52.625 --> 16:56.505
If someone has gone through life without ever being treated kindly,…

239
16:59.145 --> 17:00.625
how can she understand love?

240
17:01.585 --> 17:04.345
How can she even feel she has the right to love anyone else?

241
17:04.424 --> 17:06.905
HERE LIES MY COUSIN JUNDAI

242
17:06.985 --> 17:08.305
I cared for her,

243
17:09.145 --> 17:10.865
yet I left her too.

244
17:12.265 --> 17:16.985
Perhaps you're right. I let her down.

245
17:17.825 --> 17:19.184
You did nothing wrong.

246
17:20.785 --> 17:24.305
It is only that in your heart, many things outweighs her.

247
17:25.305 --> 17:27.505
Your family. Your honor.

248
17:31.145 --> 17:35.265
If Jundai hurt you, please don't hold it against her.

249
17:38.185 --> 17:39.785
She was someone to be pitied too.

250
18:10.305 --> 18:12.745
Lady Shou'an has been waiting at the estate for some time.

251
18:12.825 --> 18:14.025
Grandmother is here?

252
18:17.105 --> 18:18.385
Nice work.

253
18:20.065 --> 18:21.425
-You're too kind. -You've been working on it for so long.

254
18:21.505 --> 18:22.945
You're welcome.

255
18:24.585 --> 18:25.665
Back to work.

256
18:28.465 --> 18:29.745
Be careful.

257
18:29.825 --> 18:30.665
Grandmother.

258
18:33.305 --> 18:37.145
Rao, I couldn't trust anyone else to handle this,

259
18:37.825 --> 18:39.625
so I brought them here myself.

260
18:42.625 --> 18:43.905
Let me help you.

261
18:46.665 --> 18:48.625
I beg your forgiveness, Your Ladyship.

262
18:49.665 --> 18:53.145
I put you through so much. I deserve to die a thousand deaths.

263
18:53.745 --> 18:55.705
I would accept being cut to pieces.

264
18:56.945 --> 18:59.745
But please spare my two children.

265
18:59.825 --> 19:01.985
They knew nothing of it.

266
19:06.905 --> 19:10.465
Quick, kneel and kowtow to Her Ladyship. Beg for her forgiveness!

267
19:11.345 --> 19:12.585
Please get up.

268
19:13.305 --> 19:15.305
You're my elder. Don't shorten my life by kneeling to me.

269
19:16.505 --> 19:18.265
Hongxian, Runsheng, get up.

270
19:21.505 --> 19:23.465
If you hadn't found me on that mountain,

271
19:24.065 --> 19:26.145
I would have frozen to death that winter night.

272
19:26.665 --> 19:27.905
I wouldn't be here enjoying all this today.

273
19:30.345 --> 19:31.985
I don't blame you.

274
19:32.065 --> 19:35.225
I told you she was very forgiving. Never hold a grudge against us.

275
19:35.825 --> 19:38.185
Raising her means more than giving birth. It was you who raised her.

276
19:38.785 --> 19:39.945
For that alone,

277
19:40.025 --> 19:42.025
she should repay our family a thousand times over.

278
19:42.105 --> 19:43.105
What nonsense are you spouting?

279
19:43.185 --> 19:45.065
Who do you think you are to demand anything from her?

280
19:45.665 --> 19:48.945
Your Ladyship, are we still family?

281
19:50.865 --> 19:52.345
Can I still see you as my sister?

282
20:14.905 --> 20:16.225
Runsheng is right.

283
20:16.905 --> 20:18.305
Mother took me in.

284
20:18.385 --> 20:20.065
I'll remember that kindness for as long as I live.

285
20:21.945 --> 20:23.385
Go prepare food and wine.

286
20:24.225 --> 20:26.425
Yes! Bring me plenty of good wine.

287
20:26.505 --> 20:29.545
And send them up the mountain to hunt more wild ducks and pheasants!

288
20:30.225 --> 20:32.585
-Runsheng! -Go on!

289
20:38.905 --> 20:41.265
Mother, it's windy out here. Let's go inside.

290
20:42.425 --> 20:43.625
Come, Grandmother.

291
20:45.345 --> 20:48.545
-Don't worry about it. I am used to it. -That's nice.

292
20:53.025 --> 20:54.385
It's Bitao.

293
21:04.625 --> 21:05.585
Tell me.

294
21:06.385 --> 21:09.665
What arrangements will you make for Qiao and her family?

295
21:09.745 --> 21:10.585
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

296
21:10.665 --> 21:14.025
With all the building work at the estate, this is no place for Ma to recover.

297
21:14.105 --> 21:16.545
I plan to go to her hometown, Shuzhou,

298
21:16.625 --> 21:19.505
and find a quiet little courtyard house in a lively neighborhood.

299
21:20.025 --> 21:22.705
Then Ma can move there with Hongxian and Runsheng.

300
21:23.225 --> 21:25.745
Runsheng is lazy and undisciplined.

301
21:25.825 --> 21:27.065
I'll find him an apprenticeship.

302
21:27.665 --> 21:30.065
Hongxian is bright.

303
21:30.145 --> 21:32.505
I'll find her a virtuous, accomplished female tutor

304
21:32.585 --> 21:33.905
to give her a proper education.

305
21:34.625 --> 21:36.265
I'll have them sent there tonight.

306
21:37.425 --> 21:40.625
Shuzhou, with its lovely hills and rivers,

307
21:42.225 --> 21:45.145
is certainly a fine place for recuperation.

308
21:45.825 --> 21:49.625
For someone her age, returning to her hometown is a comfort.

309
21:49.705 --> 21:53.305
I'm sure your adoptive mother will be content.

310
21:53.825 --> 21:54.745
Yes.

311
21:56.905 --> 21:59.945
Compassion is a form of wisdom.

312
22:00.625 --> 22:02.505
Qiao is selfish.

313
22:02.585 --> 22:05.025
Even so, she saved your life.

314
22:05.105 --> 22:07.705
You must treat her well and let everyone see

315
22:07.785 --> 22:10.505
your kindness and compassion,

316
22:10.585 --> 22:13.065
so they'll know you're worthy of their loyalty.

317
22:13.665 --> 22:14.865
This is something

318
22:14.945 --> 22:17.985
your birth mother doesn't understand.

319
22:18.585 --> 22:21.185
In that respect, you're better than she is.

320
22:21.265 --> 22:24.425
But you've made a serious mistake.

321
22:25.985 --> 22:27.225
Please enlighten me, Grandmother.

322
22:27.985 --> 22:29.985
You shouldn't have divorced Lu Zhuo.

323
22:32.625 --> 22:36.665
The Lu family's heir had the ability and family standing

324
22:37.305 --> 22:38.825
to be a worthy match for you.

325
22:38.905 --> 22:41.665
Above all, he cared for you

326
22:41.745 --> 22:43.745
and could give you the strongest support.

327
22:44.265 --> 22:45.505
With your intelligence,

328
22:45.585 --> 22:49.425
you should have kept him firmly in the palm of your hand.

329
22:50.345 --> 22:51.785
He could offer you protection.

330
22:51.865 --> 22:53.465
Why did you let him get away?

331
22:54.825 --> 22:57.585
I didn't let him get away. I set him free.

332
23:05.025 --> 23:05.865
Well,

333
23:06.505 --> 23:09.145
your mother is far more ruthless than you.

334
23:09.225 --> 23:12.625
To her, men are merely precious gems in her phoenix crown

335
23:12.705 --> 23:14.825
or the sharpest swords in her hand.

336
23:15.425 --> 23:16.625
But Rao,…

337
23:19.265 --> 23:22.985
letting him go will bring you a great deal of trouble.

338
23:23.865 --> 23:25.305
What trouble?

339
23:25.385 --> 23:27.145
Those caught in a storm

340
23:27.745 --> 23:30.785
often fail to see the danger right before them.

341
23:31.825 --> 23:35.665
Your mother sees it, yet she still lets you have your way.

342
23:35.745 --> 23:39.145
Possessing a treasure can make an innocent man a target.

343
23:39.825 --> 23:44.465
It won't be long before you understand that.

344
23:50.625 --> 23:52.945
Runsheng!

345
23:53.025 --> 23:54.025
ZHUYU ESTATE

346
23:54.105 --> 23:55.465
Let go of him!

347
23:56.065 --> 23:57.185
-Hit him! -Runsheng…

348
23:58.185 --> 24:00.345
-It's all mine! -Runsheng!

349
24:00.945 --> 24:03.785
-More wine! I want more! -Runsheng!

350
24:06.585 --> 24:10.865
Hongxian, when you reach Shuzhou, someone will help you settle in.

351
24:11.545 --> 24:13.665
Take good care of Ma.

352
24:19.585 --> 24:23.945
You've cared for us for so many years. I'll never forget it as long as I live.

353
24:24.945 --> 24:28.545
From now on, I'll care for Mother myself and keep Runsheng in line.

354
24:31.105 --> 24:32.385
Take care of yourself, Rao.

355
24:43.545 --> 24:44.385
Go on.

356
25:16.585 --> 25:17.505
Wei Rao,…

357
25:21.305 --> 25:22.945
you're no longer A-Chou.

358
25:36.865 --> 25:39.145
GENTLE AS A SOFT BREEZE

359
25:39.225 --> 25:40.065
Zhuo!

360
25:40.585 --> 25:41.785
-Zhuo! -General Qi.

361
25:41.865 --> 25:43.185
His Lordship is ill.

362
25:43.265 --> 25:45.905
-Move aside. It's urgent. -General Qi, His Lordship…

363
25:47.785 --> 25:49.065
I hear you've divorced the Noble Lady?

364
25:49.945 --> 25:51.465
You knew already?

365
25:51.545 --> 25:53.545
His Majesty issued the decree himself, granting the divorce.

366
25:54.145 --> 25:56.425
Noble Lady Wu'an's dowry was carried out of the Duke's Residence.

367
25:56.505 --> 25:58.385
In less than an hour, the news had spread everywhere.

368
25:59.425 --> 26:01.785
Who in the capital doesn't know?

369
26:03.105 --> 26:04.905
Is that all you came to ask?

370
26:05.825 --> 26:08.105
Zhuo, are you really letting her go?

371
26:10.425 --> 26:11.785
What does that have to do with you?

372
26:17.545 --> 26:20.505
"A fair lady is a gentleman's ideal match."

373
26:21.945 --> 26:25.145
My friend, if I marry Noble Lady Wu'an,

374
26:26.305 --> 26:27.465
will you turn against me?

375
26:28.145 --> 26:30.305
Do you only know that one line from "Guan Ju"?

376
26:32.025 --> 26:33.425
What about the saying,

377
26:34.505 --> 26:37.785
"A friend's wife is off limits"?

378
26:42.465 --> 26:45.185
Ever since we were children, I've never competed with you for anything.

379
26:46.585 --> 26:49.545
But this time, I can't step aside for you.

380
26:50.185 --> 26:51.745
There's only one Wei Rao in this world.

381
26:52.345 --> 26:54.105
Plenty of noble ladies in the capital.

382
26:55.025 --> 26:56.305
Why have you set your heart on her?

383
26:57.865 --> 27:01.025
Actually, I knew very early on she was an imposter.

384
27:02.465 --> 27:03.825
But I didn't care.

385
27:03.905 --> 27:08.265
Her beauty doesn't come from her looks or her birth.

386
27:08.785 --> 27:12.065
All she has to do is stand there, and she lights up everything around her.

387
27:12.745 --> 27:16.185
That day, I watched from the city gate tower as she tore up the land deeds.

388
27:16.265 --> 27:18.305
HENGCHENG GATE

389
27:21.025 --> 27:23.985
It suddenly struck me that I'd never meet another woman

390
27:24.065 --> 27:25.905
who could compare to Wei Rao.

391
27:28.785 --> 27:29.625
Fine.

392
27:30.505 --> 27:31.705
Go court your fair lady, then!

393
27:35.105 --> 27:36.105
I won't stand in your way.

394
27:37.385 --> 27:39.745
Who are you to stop me? You're the one who's been cast aside.

395
27:44.385 --> 27:47.385
To tell you the truth, if I had a wife like her,

396
27:47.465 --> 27:50.865
I'd stay by her side every day and never give another man a chance.

397
27:51.745 --> 27:54.945
Now that you've let her go, even if I didn't pursue her,

398
27:55.025 --> 27:58.505
men would still flock to her in droves because of her title.

399
27:59.105 --> 28:00.305
If you don't believe me, just wait and see.

400
28:00.905 --> 28:02.105
I told you it's none of my concern.

401
28:04.345 --> 28:05.385
You really don't mind?

402
28:06.225 --> 28:07.185
I'm tired.

403
28:09.025 --> 28:09.905
Get out, will you?

404
28:10.905 --> 28:13.745
All right, all right. I won't bother you.

405
28:14.265 --> 28:17.025
Now that I have your answer,

406
28:17.105 --> 28:20.105
-I can rest easy! -Show him out!

407
28:24.985 --> 28:26.145
Zhuo.

408
28:27.505 --> 28:30.785
Rest well, and don't worry!

409
28:39.185 --> 28:41.145
My Lord, your medicine.

410
28:41.225 --> 28:42.065
No need.

411
28:48.305 --> 28:49.225
My Lord,

412
28:49.305 --> 28:51.305
some larger items from the Noble Lady's dowry

413
28:51.385 --> 28:52.625
were left behind because they're hard to move.

414
28:53.345 --> 28:55.985
Her Grace ordered me to deliver them to Zhuyu Estate.

415
28:57.465 --> 29:00.385
-Zhuyu? -The Noble Lady chose the name herself.

416
29:01.625 --> 29:04.625
In the legends, Zhuyu is a wild herb that grows on Mount Zhaoyao

417
29:04.705 --> 29:06.265
and keeps hunger at bay.

418
29:08.465 --> 29:09.905
She certainly isn't picky.

419
29:10.865 --> 29:14.185
-Help me up. -My Lord, where are you going now?

420
29:21.225 --> 29:22.185
Zhuyu Estate.

421
29:22.265 --> 29:25.025
ZHUYU ESTATE

422
29:26.025 --> 29:27.865
I found this while reclaiming land in the mountains.

423
29:28.465 --> 29:29.825
It looks like wheat.

424
29:30.425 --> 29:32.785
Wheat berries aren't that small. It's clearly a wild grass.

425
29:32.865 --> 29:35.065
It's called brome, also known as cheat grass.

426
29:35.145 --> 29:37.665
People often eat it during famines.

427
29:38.265 --> 29:39.745
Try grinding it into flour.

428
29:40.265 --> 29:41.665
Have you eaten it too, Your Ladyship?

429
29:41.745 --> 29:43.545
Don't be foolish. Her Ladyship would never eat this.

430
29:44.145 --> 29:46.025
-She's simply very knowledgeable. -Yes, of course.

431
29:46.105 --> 29:48.265
The notice says that anyone who finds

432
29:48.345 --> 29:50.385
food plants or medicinal herbs in the mountains will be rewarded.

433
29:50.465 --> 29:51.305
Is that true?

434
29:51.385 --> 29:52.985
-Keep it safe. -All right.

435
29:53.065 --> 29:54.185
Gejin.

436
29:58.065 --> 30:00.225
Your Ladyship is so kindhearted. Heaven will bless you.

437
30:01.025 --> 30:03.065
Don't let the brome seeds fall into the wheat fields.

438
30:03.145 --> 30:04.345
They'll ruin the crop.

439
30:04.425 --> 30:05.265
-Yes. -Yes.

440
30:08.505 --> 30:10.345
Here she comes. That's her.

441
30:10.425 --> 30:11.625
The girl with the scar on her face.

442
30:12.265 --> 30:13.825
She barely says a word all day.

443
30:13.905 --> 30:15.545
She always takes the hardest, most tiring work

444
30:15.625 --> 30:17.425
and works even harder than the men.

445
30:17.505 --> 30:18.625
What a strange girl.

446
30:20.225 --> 30:21.665
That's a lot of firewood.

447
30:30.665 --> 30:32.465
I'm heading home to cook.

448
30:33.585 --> 30:36.105
Your Ladyship, Lord Han requests to see you.

449
30:36.185 --> 30:37.305
Lord Han?

450
30:41.705 --> 30:44.385
I, Han Liao, come bearing rods to beg Noble Lady Wu'an's forgiveness.

451
30:45.185 --> 30:46.705
I had a funeral to arrange,

452
30:46.785 --> 30:48.225
so I was late in taking up my duties as your servant.

453
30:49.105 --> 30:51.025
I've come to offer my apology.

454
30:51.825 --> 30:52.705
I wouldn't dare accept.

455
30:55.985 --> 30:58.985
His Majesty gave a verbal decree ordering me to serve you

456
30:59.065 --> 31:01.345
for one month. I dare not disobey.

457
31:01.425 --> 31:03.385
If you put our past behind us and take me in,

458
31:03.465 --> 31:04.785
it would be an act of great generosity.

459
31:08.065 --> 31:12.145
If you command it, I'll brave any danger.

460
31:14.705 --> 31:15.545
Look over there.

461
31:17.105 --> 31:19.465
My maid carries 80 jin of firewood every day,

462
31:20.145 --> 31:22.025
yet you've brought only a few rods to beg forgiveness.

463
31:22.105 --> 31:25.665
You clearly aren't sincere. What use would you be to me?

464
31:27.065 --> 31:31.265
You think too highly of yourself, Han! Her Ladyship can't stand the sight of you.

465
31:31.345 --> 31:32.785
Get out of here!

466
31:32.865 --> 31:36.105
Wei Rao, he has a glib tongue and sinister intentions.

467
31:36.185 --> 31:37.985
Don't let him fool you.

468
31:38.065 --> 31:41.105
The moment you heard she'd left the Duke's Residence,

469
31:41.185 --> 31:43.385
you couldn't wait to come running.

470
31:43.465 --> 31:47.385
If we're talking about ulterior motives, you're no better than I am, General Qi.

471
31:47.985 --> 31:50.025
Lord Lu and I have never gotten along.

472
31:50.105 --> 31:51.425
It's only natural for me to come here.

473
31:52.025 --> 31:54.265
But you and Lu Zhuo are the closest of friends.

474
31:54.345 --> 31:56.225
To come here and win her favor,

475
31:56.985 --> 31:57.905
do you have no shame?

476
31:58.625 --> 32:01.585
If I weren't here, how could I keep scoundrels like you away?

477
32:02.465 --> 32:05.105
You're a weasel in human form, always looking for a gap.

478
32:05.705 --> 32:07.105
As if they deserve a thing.

479
32:08.825 --> 32:11.305
Bring it over! Let Her Ladyship see!

480
32:15.745 --> 32:16.745
What's this for?

481
32:17.345 --> 32:18.665
Didn't Your Ladyship want to learn horse riding?

482
32:19.265 --> 32:20.825
I pick a fine horse from the Western Regions for you.

483
32:20.905 --> 32:22.905
It crosses mountains as easily as flat ground.

484
32:22.985 --> 32:24.665
A thousand li a day is nothing to it.

485
32:24.745 --> 32:26.345
Come. I have some free time today.

486
32:26.425 --> 32:27.665
I'll teach you to ride.

487
32:30.145 --> 32:30.985
You may go.

488
32:33.705 --> 32:34.905
-I'd like to try. -Sure.

489
32:36.345 --> 32:37.745
Han Liao, are you deliberately causing trouble?

490
32:38.585 --> 32:41.065
I volunteer to lead your horse and hold your stirrup, Your Ladyship.

491
32:43.145 --> 32:46.345
Lord Han, you'd stoop this low?

492
32:46.425 --> 32:48.665
Aren't you afraid of being laughed at?

493
32:48.745 --> 32:52.425
You're crude and lack common sense, General Qi.

494
32:53.305 --> 32:55.545
Beginners can easily fall and injure themselves.

495
32:55.625 --> 32:59.105
With me by her side, Her Ladyship's safety is assured.

496
33:01.545 --> 33:03.105
Stop making trouble.

497
33:04.065 --> 33:05.945
Your Ladyship, Lord Lu is here.

498
33:29.745 --> 33:30.825
Lord Han.

499
33:31.905 --> 33:35.145
This horse may be gentle, but it's rather tall.

500
33:37.065 --> 33:38.305
I need a mounting block.

501
33:45.305 --> 33:46.945
Use me as your mounting block,

502
33:47.025 --> 33:49.185
and you'll settle into the saddle more securely.

503
33:49.265 --> 33:50.105
Your Ladyship, please.

504
33:50.705 --> 33:53.545
Such shameless groveling. Have you no dignity?

505
33:54.305 --> 33:56.865
Such bitter jealousy. How petty you are.

506
34:01.425 --> 34:02.345
Bend over.

507
34:18.264 --> 34:20.865
Is this human mounting block to your liking, Your Ladyship?

508
34:22.385 --> 34:24.344
You'll do as a lowly groom.

509
34:25.865 --> 34:27.304
When it comes to riding and archery,

510
34:27.385 --> 34:29.865
I won't claim to be the best in the world,

511
34:29.945 --> 34:31.185
but I'm more than qualified to teach Your Ladyship.

512
34:31.264 --> 34:32.784
If you wish, I can…

513
34:33.905 --> 34:36.145
I didn't ask you anything. You're a mere groom.

514
34:36.225 --> 34:37.304
How dare you speak out of turn?

515
34:37.385 --> 34:40.065
Wei Rao, let me teach you instead.

516
34:42.545 --> 34:43.385
Let's go.

517
34:45.865 --> 34:48.065
You'd even fight over being her groom.

518
34:48.145 --> 34:50.025
-Have you no dignity? -Get lost!

519
34:50.105 --> 34:53.145
I'm happy to do it. Better than being a groveling, mangy dog like you.

520
34:53.225 --> 34:54.425
-Let go. -You let go.

521
34:55.985 --> 34:57.785
-It's my horse. -I don't care!

522
34:57.865 --> 34:59.625
-Let go! -Let go!

523
34:59.705 --> 35:00.745
Let go now!

524
35:00.825 --> 35:02.025
You let go!

525
35:02.105 --> 35:03.865
-Doesn't your leg hurt? -Let go!

526
35:03.945 --> 35:05.465
You have no shame!

527
35:05.545 --> 35:07.105
And you do?

528
35:09.745 --> 35:12.265
My Lord, shall I help you…?

529
35:12.865 --> 35:13.785
Back to the residence.

530
35:13.865 --> 35:15.385
My Lord, you came all this way despite being ill.

531
35:15.465 --> 35:18.105
You haven't even spoken to Her Ladyship, and you're leaving already?

532
35:20.385 --> 35:21.305
She's having too much fun…

533
35:21.385 --> 35:22.825
-Let go! -…to spare me a glance.

534
35:22.905 --> 35:24.545
-Let go! -Go away!

535
35:24.625 --> 35:26.225
Why stay and be a nuisance?

536
35:26.305 --> 35:27.425
It's my horse! Get lost!

537
35:27.505 --> 35:28.465
Get moving!

538
35:29.385 --> 35:30.305
Go!

539
35:30.385 --> 35:31.545
You're such a scoundrel!

540
35:31.625 --> 35:32.465
-I'll lead it. -Let go!

541
35:33.465 --> 35:34.305
Give it to me!

542
35:35.265 --> 35:36.345
Will you let go already?

543
35:38.745 --> 35:39.785
You just won't stop!

544
35:39.865 --> 35:40.705
Stop.

545
35:46.985 --> 35:47.825
You needn't follow me.

546
35:50.425 --> 35:51.545
That goes for you too.

547
35:57.145 --> 35:59.825
Qi Zhongkai, don't get too pleased with yourself.

548
36:00.665 --> 36:04.265
Noble Lady Wu'an may not get to decide whom she marries for herself.

549
36:05.265 --> 36:09.065
Who will take this thorny rose home

550
36:10.385 --> 36:11.345
remains to be seen.

551
36:11.425 --> 36:13.585
Don't even dream of it!

552
36:13.665 --> 36:15.385
Whoever she chooses, it won't be you.

553
36:16.105 --> 36:18.025
You can wait till you go blind, you groveling dog,

554
36:18.625 --> 36:19.745
and you'll still never have her.

555
36:24.345 --> 36:25.945
Keep your eyes open

556
36:27.705 --> 36:28.905
and wait and see.

557
36:29.785 --> 36:30.865
Let's go!

558
36:36.545 --> 36:37.545
Your Ladyship,

559
36:37.625 --> 36:39.185
The estate is currently building grounds and garden plots.

560
36:39.265 --> 36:43.105
To renovate the buildings, we're using salvaged bricks and tiles.

561
36:43.185 --> 36:45.425
The cost is low. It's mostly a matter of labor.

562
36:46.025 --> 36:48.105
And that is exactly what we have plenty of.

563
36:48.625 --> 36:50.625
In my humble opinion, the large courtyard on the west side

564
36:50.705 --> 36:52.185
can be turned into a brewery.

565
36:52.265 --> 36:54.305
The northern section can be used to raise silkworms and spin yarn.

566
36:54.385 --> 36:57.025
That way, we'll earn considerably more next year.

567
36:58.665 --> 36:59.785
Your Ladyship!

568
37:00.425 --> 37:01.705
Your Ladyship.

569
37:01.785 --> 37:02.625
AS THE SUN RISES

570
37:02.705 --> 37:04.625
There are so many people outside!

571
37:04.705 --> 37:05.545
Please come and see!

572
37:06.545 --> 37:07.505
Your Ladyship!

573
37:07.585 --> 37:09.145
We want to see Her Ladyship!

574
37:09.225 --> 37:10.145
Let us in!

575
37:10.225 --> 37:12.065
We want to see Her Ladyship!

576
37:12.145 --> 37:14.545
-We request an audience with Her Ladyship! -Let us in!

577
37:14.625 --> 37:17.065
-She's not receiving visitors today. -Let us see her!

578
37:17.145 --> 37:18.345
Please leave, everyone!

579
37:19.105 --> 37:20.345
Close the gates!

580
37:20.985 --> 37:22.185
-Hurry! -Just let us see her!

581
37:22.265 --> 37:24.065
There are so many people. It'll be terrible if trouble breaks out.

582
37:24.145 --> 37:25.225
What do we do?

583
37:25.305 --> 37:27.825
-Your Ladyship! -Your Ladyship!

584
37:27.905 --> 37:29.825
CAISHU HALL

585
37:30.545 --> 37:32.305
-Who are those people outside? -Your Ladyship.

586
37:32.385 --> 37:33.345
Those people are…

587
37:33.425 --> 37:37.145
They're poor people who own land in nearby prefectures and counties.

588
37:37.225 --> 37:38.505
They've come to seek Your Ladyship's protection.

589
37:39.185 --> 37:40.065
It's common for jobless drifters with no land

590
37:40.145 --> 37:41.465
to come and seek my protection.

591
37:42.545 --> 37:45.225
Why would people who own land come?

592
37:45.305 --> 37:47.825
Your Ladyship, His Majesty understands the people's hardships,

593
37:47.905 --> 37:49.745
so he's graciously offered state farmland

594
37:49.825 --> 37:50.945
for displaced people to rent and cultivate.

595
37:51.705 --> 37:53.345
He's exempted them from taxes for the first five years

596
37:53.425 --> 37:56.705
and lent them seeds and farm tools free of charge. Unfortunately…

597
37:56.785 --> 37:59.065
Unfortunately, the powerful nobles are too greedy.

598
37:59.665 --> 38:01.465
They often bribe land officials to seize the land.

599
38:02.265 --> 38:05.425
They take 80 percent of the harvest from the poor people's fields,

600
38:05.505 --> 38:08.025
yet they pay the state very little tax, or none at all.

601
38:09.105 --> 38:10.305
When these people heard that you

602
38:10.905 --> 38:13.265
reduced rents and treated tenants well,

603
38:13.345 --> 38:15.305
they rushed to offer you their land,

604
38:16.025 --> 38:19.105
hoping to keep the harvest they've worked for all year.

605
38:19.625 --> 38:22.145
Please show compassion and help them.

606
38:22.225 --> 38:25.305
Your Ladyship, don't be tempted by petty gains.

607
38:25.385 --> 38:27.105
So many people are offering their land and property

608
38:27.185 --> 38:28.625
in return for your protection. Once you take them in,

609
38:28.705 --> 38:30.665
you'll make enemies of the great noble families.

610
38:30.745 --> 38:33.265
Beware. Tall trees catch the wind. You could provoke their wrath.

611
38:33.345 --> 38:34.905
Such cowardice.

612
38:34.985 --> 38:37.345
Your Ladyship, your maternal grandmother

613
38:37.425 --> 38:39.865
is the wet nurse His Majesty respects most.

614
38:39.945 --> 38:41.025
Your mother is his favored consort,

615
38:41.105 --> 38:44.265
and your own brother is the Fourth Prince.

616
38:44.345 --> 38:45.745
You have the power to stand against the nobles.

617
38:45.825 --> 38:48.225
What do their deaths have to do with Her Ladyship?

618
38:49.345 --> 38:52.785
Liu Ziyang, you're afraid they'll be forced to starve to death.

619
38:52.865 --> 38:54.705
But have you spared a thought for Her Ladyship?

620
38:54.785 --> 38:56.385
Her Ladyship has treated you with such respect.

621
38:56.465 --> 38:57.385
Why offer advice that will harm her?

622
38:58.265 --> 39:00.065
You've left the Duke's Residence, Your Ladyship.

623
39:00.945 --> 39:03.105
If you turn these people away as well,

624
39:03.185 --> 39:05.505
you'll be telling everyone you lack the power to protect them.

625
39:06.425 --> 39:08.265
You own vast stretches of fertile land.

626
39:08.345 --> 39:10.665
Everyone wants a piece of it.

627
39:11.305 --> 39:12.985
When the noble families

628
39:13.705 --> 39:15.225
close in on you like wolves and tigers,

629
39:15.825 --> 39:17.545
even if you give up your land and property,

630
39:18.065 --> 39:19.625
you may not be able to save yourself.

631
39:19.705 --> 39:22.025
Liu Ziyang, hold your tongue!

632
39:28.625 --> 39:30.065
Open the gates!

633
39:32.705 --> 39:35.385
On behalf of the people, I thank Your Ladyship for your kindness.

634
39:35.465 --> 39:37.465
Your Ladyship, you mustn't!

635
39:37.545 --> 39:39.545
You'll offend all the nobles.

636
39:39.625 --> 39:41.025
Disaster is sure to follow!

637
39:41.625 --> 39:42.745
Mr. Liu,

638
39:43.785 --> 39:47.025
you grew up in poverty, so you understand the people's hardships.

639
39:47.705 --> 39:50.585
But you accept my pay, so you owe me your loyalty.

640
39:52.225 --> 39:54.745
An adviser who pushes their master into danger

641
39:54.825 --> 39:56.185
deserves to die a hundred times over.

642
39:57.585 --> 40:00.185
Do it again, and I'll throw you out of the estate.

643
40:02.505 --> 40:04.425
Everyone who comes to me for refuge

644
40:05.265 --> 40:06.225
is entitled to my protection.

645
40:07.545 --> 40:10.665
Go. Register the people offering their land.

646
40:11.905 --> 40:12.945
Yes.

647
40:14.065 --> 40:16.465
Open the gates! Open them now!

648
40:16.545 --> 40:17.745
Your Ladyship!

649
40:17.825 --> 40:19.025
Listen carefully.

650
40:19.625 --> 40:21.145
Set up a complaint box outside the gates.

651
40:21.745 --> 40:23.585
Anyone whose land's been seized or who's been abused by the nobles…

652
40:23.665 --> 40:24.785
-Please step back, everyone! -Can put a written complaint in the box…

653
40:24.865 --> 40:25.705
Line up, everyone!

654
40:25.785 --> 40:27.305
I'll remove the names of the complainants.

655
40:27.385 --> 40:30.265
-One at a time. -Only take in those who farm state land.

656
40:30.345 --> 40:32.665
-Register everyone. -Don't accept a mu of private land.

657
40:33.265 --> 40:34.345
People love to accuse

658
40:34.425 --> 40:36.545
my maternal grandmother and mother of exploiting their imperial ties.

659
40:36.625 --> 40:38.545
We might as well earn that reputation.

660
40:38.625 --> 40:40.385
If anyone comes seeking revenge,

661
40:40.905 --> 40:43.265
I'll present proof of his crimes to His Majesty.

662
40:44.105 --> 40:46.385
Seizing state land is a capital crime.

663
40:47.265 --> 40:48.825
Life is only a few decades long.

664
40:48.905 --> 40:50.745
-Line up! -Every extra day is a bonus.

665
40:50.825 --> 40:53.585
-I might as well live boldly and fiercely. -Next.

666
40:54.265 --> 40:55.345
Let's see

667
40:55.945 --> 40:58.785
who dares cross me first.

668
41:08.585 --> 41:09.425
Understood.

669
41:09.505 --> 41:11.945
Make way!

670
41:12.025 --> 41:13.385
My niece!

671
41:13.465 --> 41:16.225
My dear niece, Your Ladyship!

672
41:18.225 --> 41:19.665
What brings you here, Uncle Jiu?

673
41:19.745 --> 41:21.945
Your grandmother is gravely ill. I've come to fetch you myself.

674
41:22.025 --> 41:23.305
Grandmother is gravely ill?

675
41:24.185 --> 41:25.145
Gejin, prepare the carriage.

676
41:25.225 --> 41:26.265
Yes.

677
41:26.945 --> 41:29.865
I'd heard of Zhuyu Estate's wealth and splendor.

678
41:29.945 --> 41:31.305
I thought people were just exaggerating.

679
41:31.385 --> 41:33.785
But now I see there's far more to it than that!

680
41:33.865 --> 41:36.785
The estate is vast, but your influence is even greater!

681
41:37.585 --> 41:39.865
Lady Li still enjoys His Majesty's favor.

682
41:39.945 --> 41:42.905
His affection for her has clearly extended to you.

683
41:42.985 --> 41:45.305
Gentlemen, I'll leave this in your hands.

684
41:45.385 --> 41:47.185
-One at a time! -Let's go, Uncle Jiu.

685
41:47.785 --> 41:50.025
We're leaving already? Won't you show me around?

686
41:51.465 --> 41:53.305
-I know you're worried. -Next!

687
41:53.385 --> 41:55.385
I'll visit another day. Let's go.

688
41:55.465 --> 41:56.505
-Thank you, Your Ladyship! -Thank you, Your Ladyship!

689
41:56.585 --> 41:57.505
Incredible!

690
41:57.585 --> 41:59.585
-Thank you, Your Ladyship! -Thank you, Your Ladyship!

691
41:59.665 --> 42:01.105
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

692
42:19.505 --> 42:20.985
Wei Jin,

693
42:21.785 --> 42:23.825
is that you?

694
42:24.545 --> 42:26.545
Grandmother, it's me.

695
42:27.345 --> 42:28.225
I've come home.

696
42:28.305 --> 42:31.145
Dowager Lady, it's not Lord Wei Jin.

697
42:31.225 --> 42:33.745
Lady Rao has come back especially to see you.

698
42:34.665 --> 42:35.985
Rao.

699
42:37.585 --> 42:38.425
No.

700
42:39.945 --> 42:41.705
I don't want to see her.

701
42:42.305 --> 42:45.265
I'm too ashamed to face her.

702
42:45.345 --> 42:47.065
I don't want to see her.

703
42:48.065 --> 42:50.985
It's only been a few days. How did Grandmother become so ill?

704
42:54.265 --> 42:56.305
WEI SHU, PRINCESS CONSORT DUAN

705
42:56.905 --> 42:59.345
Grandmother fell ill after returning from Xianzhuang.

706
43:00.985 --> 43:04.185
Overnight, her hair turned white.

707
43:06.705 --> 43:09.345
Rao, I'm your eldest cousin.

708
43:11.945 --> 43:12.905
Greetings, Princess Consort Duan.

709
43:14.385 --> 43:16.105
Rao,

710
43:17.825 --> 43:20.545
I've wronged you.

711
43:22.305 --> 43:26.225
I kept saying I'd protect you.

712
43:27.585 --> 43:29.225
But the truth is,

713
43:30.025 --> 43:32.305
I still harbored resentment

714
43:34.025 --> 43:37.225
toward your mother.

715
43:37.985 --> 43:40.105
I was selfish.

716
43:41.105 --> 43:42.865
I was foolish.

717
43:43.865 --> 43:45.545
Rao,

718
43:46.505 --> 43:49.265
I've wronged you

719
43:50.025 --> 43:54.145
and my son who died so young.

720
43:54.225 --> 43:55.425
My son…

721
43:56.945 --> 43:57.785
Grandmother,

722
43:59.025 --> 44:01.025
thank you for telling me the truth.

723
44:02.225 --> 44:03.105
I don't blame you.

724
44:06.145 --> 44:09.585
Don't stop me! Wei Rao! You owe me my mother's life!

725
44:09.665 --> 44:12.665
Chan, don't be rude to Her Ladyship! Chan!

726
44:14.945 --> 44:16.105
Wei Chan,

727
44:17.145 --> 44:20.145
your mother switched the babies and poisoned Jundai.

728
44:20.225 --> 44:22.465
She killed herself to escape punishment.

729
44:22.545 --> 44:23.585
No one else is to blame.

730
44:23.665 --> 44:24.545
Nonsense!

731
44:25.145 --> 44:26.985
Lady Li forced her to kill herself.

732
44:27.065 --> 44:29.305
You and your mother are both murderers!

733
44:29.385 --> 44:31.705
-Chan, hold your tongue! -Shu,

734
44:32.225 --> 44:34.065
she caused our mother's death.

735
44:34.145 --> 44:35.345
How can you take an outsider's side?

736
44:35.425 --> 44:39.145
Father told me everything that happened.

737
44:40.665 --> 44:43.265
Mother's wrongdoing left Her Ladyship to fend for herself as a commoner.

738
44:44.145 --> 44:46.625
Lady Li and Noble Lady Wu'an have held no one else accountable.

739
44:46.705 --> 44:47.785
That alone is a great act of mercy.

740
44:48.625 --> 44:51.665
What right do you have to blame the victim?

741
44:55.665 --> 44:57.705
She was the mother who gave birth to us.

742
44:58.305 --> 45:00.465
Are you putting justice above your own family

743
45:00.545 --> 45:02.265
just to make yourself look virtuous?

744
45:02.345 --> 45:03.905
Mother was in the wrong!

745
45:04.585 --> 45:07.785
I've taught you since you were little to have a conscience

746
45:07.865 --> 45:09.505
and know where to draw the line.

747
45:09.585 --> 45:12.065
You must learn to tell right from wrong.

748
45:13.265 --> 45:15.625
Governess Wang, take her back to her room

749
45:15.705 --> 45:16.905
and keep her confined!

750
45:16.985 --> 45:18.385
Yes.

751
45:18.465 --> 45:20.425
-You're always so heartless. -Take Lady Chan away.

752
45:20.505 --> 45:23.145
Are you still our mother's daughter? Are you still my sister?

753
45:23.225 --> 45:25.145
-Are you? Answer me! -Lady Chan.

754
45:25.225 --> 45:26.385
-Lady Chan. -Let go of me!

755
45:27.225 --> 45:28.505
Let go!

756
45:31.745 --> 45:33.385
Chan is still reeling from Mother's death,

757
45:33.985 --> 45:35.545
so she's struggling to stay composed.

758
45:35.625 --> 45:36.945
Please forgive her behavior.

759
45:37.745 --> 45:39.705
You're Uncle Jin's daughter

760
45:40.225 --> 45:41.385
and my younger cousin.

761
45:42.065 --> 45:43.705
For the wrongs my mother committed,

762
45:44.265 --> 45:46.025
I'll make amends in the years to come.

763
45:46.785 --> 45:48.625
You are truly noble-minded, Your Highness.

764
45:49.265 --> 45:50.345
I truly admire you.

765
45:50.945 --> 45:54.185
I thought you would hate me.

766
45:55.585 --> 45:58.825
Mother's death has saddened me too.

767
45:59.865 --> 46:01.665
But I've had an education.

768
46:01.745 --> 46:04.825
I understand what truly matters, and I know right from wrong.

769
46:05.385 --> 46:06.545
It was a feud among our elders,

770
46:06.625 --> 46:08.705
yet you were innocently caught up in it.

771
46:09.345 --> 46:10.585
How could I bear to blame you too?

772
46:15.185 --> 46:16.985
I believe sincerity earns sincerity in return.

773
46:18.145 --> 46:19.225
I hope that one day,

774
46:19.985 --> 46:21.345
you'll truly see me as family

775
46:21.865 --> 46:23.105
and call me Shu.

776
46:25.225 --> 46:26.945
Only you and I are left to uphold the Wei family's standing.

777
46:27.545 --> 46:31.785
We must put our grievances behind us and work together.

778
46:52.385 --> 46:54.905
Chan, please eat a little…

779
46:57.345 --> 46:59.945
Go pretend to be her loving cousin! Why bother coming to see me?

780
47:00.545 --> 47:03.705
For the sake of an outsider, you won't even avenge our mother!

781
47:11.185 --> 47:12.345
Chan,

782
47:13.345 --> 47:16.105
Father has achieved little in his career,

783
47:16.185 --> 47:18.145
and Grandmother is old and frail.

784
47:18.225 --> 47:20.385
Our household has no capable successor.

785
47:20.985 --> 47:24.865
Why do you think I was able to marry Prince Duan?

786
47:26.785 --> 47:29.825
Because Uncle Jin gave his life for the country,

787
47:30.825 --> 47:32.585
and His Majesty took our uncle's widow as a consort.

788
47:33.785 --> 47:37.025
His Majesty felt indebted to our family.

789
47:37.545 --> 47:39.425
He married me to a prince as his principal wife,

790
47:40.025 --> 47:41.265
partly to make amends

791
47:42.705 --> 47:44.625
and partly to ensure our family be good to Wei Rao.

792
47:45.625 --> 47:47.065
If Wei Rao hadn't been too young then,

793
47:47.665 --> 47:49.585
I would never be Princess Consort Duan.

794
47:50.185 --> 47:51.825
Mother benefited from the generosity,

795
47:51.905 --> 47:54.145
then repaid it by tearing Lady Li and her daughter apart.

796
47:54.665 --> 47:56.345
It was an unforgivable wrong.

797
47:57.065 --> 47:58.065
ORCHID GRACE ROOM

798
47:58.145 --> 48:01.025
But Shu, I can't move on from this!

799
48:01.105 --> 48:02.625
I can't let go of this hatred!

800
48:02.705 --> 48:04.225
-Chan… -I can't!

801
48:04.305 --> 48:05.425
Chan!

802
48:06.185 --> 48:08.305
Do you remember what I told you?

803
48:09.985 --> 48:11.785
You must know what truly matters

804
48:11.865 --> 48:13.785
and consider the bigger picture in everything.

805
48:14.305 --> 48:16.345
Live with integrity and treat others kindly.

806
48:17.185 --> 48:20.985
Swallow all the bitterness and resentment you carry in your heart.

807
48:21.945 --> 48:24.465
Be a good cousin to Noble Lady Wu'an.

808
48:25.265 --> 48:26.425
Okay?

809
48:28.785 --> 48:29.905
In life,…

810
48:33.585 --> 48:35.225
one must let go of something…

811
48:37.985 --> 48:39.985
to receive something in return.

812
51:05.665 --> 51:08.305
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
